        <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;">Insurance Photo Documentation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5560;margin:0;">We photograph every impact point, cracked cell, and bent rail before anything gets moved. Adjusters want pre-repair photos, and we make sure you have them.</p>
